                                        "entry_id": "4a39539d-a6e9-38c8-a5e6-c28b08437e14",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Long ago; in days long past."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f72c90a4-4f05-42f2-8279-72f7160ae0a7",
                                                "sense_id": "5ce79be4-413c-337a-80bc-7cfd288f1764",
                                                "text": "the recondite lore of yore"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "afd53dff-98ee-43a1-abf9-878afa59addc",
                                                "sense_id": "5ce79be4-413c-337a-80bc-7cfd288f1764",
                                                "text": "The Dev'l was piqu'd, ſuch ſaintſhip to behold, / And long'd to tempt him like good Job of old: / But Satan novv is vviſer than of yore, / And tempts by making rich, not making poor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f53a17e8-2e77-4113-a357-d24e6d8342c7",
                                                "sense_id": "5ce79be4-413c-337a-80bc-7cfd288f1764",
                                                "text": "where Abraham fed his flock of yore"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03c11563-0dcb-449c-9130-923085140fe8",
                                                "sense_id": "5ce79be4-413c-337a-80bc-7cfd288f1764",
                                                "text": "Representing the older types now are some Stroudley 0-6-0 tanks, while a Drummond \"C14\" 0-4-0 tank might still be pottering about on the Town Quays as of yore."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86ffcce4-c414-4ca8-943b-c1e062b47d04",
                                                "sense_id": "5ce79be4-413c-337a-80bc-7cfd288f1764",
                                                "text": "Now when I was a kid I had a bike with a banana seat, but for some reason, as you get older, and you get bikes, it's like you can never go back to those awesome seats of yore."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
